Task: This code adds a spherical entity with elastoplastic material properties and a green particle-based visualization to a simulation scene.
Code: scene.add_entity(
    material=gs.materials.MPM.ElastoPlastic(),
    morph=gs.morphs.Sphere(
        pos=(0.0, 0.5, 0.35),
        radius=0.1,
    ),
    surface=gs.surfaces.Default(
        color=(0.4, 1.0, 0.4),
        vis_mode="particle",
    ),
)